lesson: 222
title: Fortnights and school weeks
level: primary-3
stars: 0
explain: A fortnight is two weeks, so it is 14 days. The word is used a lot in Britain, Ireland, Australia and New Zealand.
explain: A school week has 5 school days, Monday to Friday; Saturday and Sunday are the weekend.
explain: 2 fortnights and 3 days: 2 × 14 = 28 days, and 28 + 3 = 31 days.
vars: a=name f=2..5 d=2..12
answer: f * 14 + d
exercise: The summer camp lasts {f} fortnights and {d} days. How many days is the camp?
exercise: {a} is away on holiday for {f} fortnights and {d} days. How many days is {a.he} away?
exercise: A library book may be kept for {f} fortnights and {d} days. For how many days may it be kept?
exercise: The roadworks outside {a}'s school will last {f} fortnights and {d} days. How many days will they last?
exercise: {a}'s cousin stays with the family for {f} fortnights and {d} days. How many days does the cousin stay?
exercise: camping for {f} fortnights n {d} days this summer!! how many days is that
exercise: nan's here for {f} fortnights and, uh, {d} days. days?
exercise: {a} off school sick {f} fortnights, sorry, {f} fortnights and {d} days. how many days
exercise: the pool's shut {f} fortnights + {d} days, how many days thats
exercise: we're at the caravan {f} fortnights and {d} days, {d+3} of us in it lol. how many days
exercise: How many days are there in {f} fortnights and {d} days?
test: Give {f} fortnights and {d} days as a number of days.
test: For {f} fortnights and another {d} days the shop is closed. How many days is it closed?
test: The puppy must stay inside for {f} fortnights and {d} days after its injections. How many days is that?
test: how long is {f} fortnights n {d} days in days
test: {a} says {f} fortnights and {d} days is {f*2+d} days. nah right? how many really
test: {a} went to {f+1} parties last month and has a holiday of {f} fortnights and {d} days next month. How many days long is the holiday?
exam: Determine the number of days comprised in a period of {f.words} fortnights and {d.words} days.
exam: It is given that a facility is to remain closed for {f} fortnights and a further {d} days. Ascertain the duration of the closure expressed in days.
exam: A loan of a volume from the library is granted for a term of {f} fortnights and {d} days. State the term of the loan in days.
exam: Compute the aggregate number of days of an excursion whose duration is stated as {f} fortnights and {d} days.
exercise: Mum was "furloughed" for {f} fortnights and {d} days. For how many days was she off work?
exercise: hamster carked it {f} fortnights n {d} days ago and the cage still stinks, bloody hell. how many days
test: The builder promised the job would take "a couple of weeks", but it took {f} fortnights and {d} days. How many days did the job really take?
